<title>USA: 2002 Target Term neutral on corporate bonds.</title>
<headline>2002 Target Term neutral on corporate bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>2002 Target term trust Inc said Friday it remained neutral on corporate bonds, as they offer little upside because of their tights yield spreads with U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>The investment company said it continues to invest in shorter-duration bonds to capture incremental yield for the portfolio. It said it maintains a &quot;cautionary approach&quot; to mortgage-backed securities market, where yields approach levels a few basis points from 18-month lows.</p>
</text>
